---
import CategoryLayout from '../layouts/CategoryLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../data/site';
---

<CategoryLayout
  categoryId="calc"
  title={`Free Online Calculators – Age, GPA, BMI | ${SITE.brand}`}
  description="Free online calculators for age, percentage, GPA, CGPA and BMI. Each one shows the formula it uses. No sign-up, and it all runs in your browser."
  h1="Free Online Calculators"
>
  <h2>Calculators that show their working</h2>
  <p>
    A result is only useful if you can trust it. Each calculator here shows the formula it
    used, so you can check the answer yourself or copy the working into an assignment.
  </p>
  <p>
    The <a href="/age-calculator">Age Calculator</a> gives an exact age in years, months and
    days and counts down to the next birthday. The
    <a href="/percentage-calculator">Percentage Calculator</a> covers the everyday cases:
    a percent of a number, percent change, marks percentage and adding or removing a
    discount. Students can use the <a href="/gpa-calculator">GPA Calculator</a> for a single
    term and the <a href="/cgpa-calculator">CGPA Calculator</a> to combine several semesters.
    The <a href="/bmi-calculator">BMI Calculator</a> works in metric or imperial units for
    adults.
  </p>
  <p>
    Grading scales and CGPA-to-percentage rules differ between universities, so always check
    your own institution's official rule before relying on a converted figure. The BMI
    calculator is for general information about adults and is not medical advice.
  </p>
  <p>
    Results update as you type, and the numbers you enter stay in your browser. You can copy a
    result or share a link that reopens the calculator with the same values.
  </p>
</CategoryLayout>
